			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711090201,
					"content": "わぁ、こんなボロボロの王山庁に、ほんとにこんな深い秘密が隠されてるなんてな。思いもしなかったぞ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090202,
						711090203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 711090202,
					"content": "#{M#俺}{F#私}もびっくりした！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711090204,
					"content": "それに、黄三もこんな場所があるって知らなかったみたいだぞ…待てよ、まさかここが伝説の「古華宝物庫」なのか！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 711090205,
					"content": "#あっ…{NICKNAME}、あそこを見ろ！足場のとこでなにか光ってるぞ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090206,
						711090207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 711090206,
					"content": "お宝だ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711090208,
					"content": "とにかく、急いで行ってみよう！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 711090207,
					"content": "何かの仕掛け？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711090203,
					"content": "まさに「見かけで判断しちゃいけない」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090204
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7110905,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7110903",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7110903,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711090501,
					"content": "「…天は信じがたく、極めても恵まれる者は稀なり。命は無常なり、盛りて衰えぬ者は少なし…目を天から得ようと、道尽きる時は訪れる。いわんやまた天目の及ばぬ者…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "碑銘"
				},
				{
					"id": 711090502,
					"content": "「…ここに碑亭を残し、後進に問う。死地に至りし時、自らをいかとすべきか？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711090503,
						711090504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "碑銘"
				},
				{
					"id": 711090503,
					"content": "（石碑に触れる。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 711090504,
					"content": "（離れる。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7110906,
